\fs60 Information:
\fs48 \

\fs36 Here is my collection of Apple's Start-Up, Crash, and Easter Egg ROM sounds.\
\
All of these files were either taken directly out of the ROM, or digitized with another Mac.\
\
Some Apple computers may have sounds which are not in this collection.  If this is the case, I would appreciate being contacted about them.\
\

\fs60 Programs Used:
\fs36 \
	Save ROM:			The program I used for saving the ROMs to binary files. \
	Brian's Sound Tool:	Use to access binary ROM files to find the sounds. \
\

\fs60 Start-Up Sounds:\

\fs36 The Start-Ups are the normal sounds that occur when any Apple computer is turned on.\
