\fs60 \cf0 Crash Sounds:\

\fs36 The Crashes (also known as the "Death Chimes") are produced by hitting the Programmer's Key (either by hitting the "Reset" button on the computer, or by hitting the "Command-Reset" keys on the keyboard) during the first stages of boot up.  It can also occur during boot up when some low-level errors occur.\
